+```
+
+Creates every ticket in `tickets`, in that order, as `POST /tickets` would: each item is `{ title, requester, priority? }`.
+At most 5000 tickets. Answers 201 with the new ids:
+
+```json
+{ "created": 2, "ids": ["T-0001", "T-0002"] }
+```
+
+Each imported ticket is recorded and its requester is notified as when one ticket is created. If any item is invalid,
+none are created (400 `invalid`); the message names the first invalid item by its index in the array (0 for the first).
